      "writtenOn": "2025-04-02T10:06:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Bindings are grouped by type in the bind group layout, so if it would help performance, we could iterate all the uniform buffers, then all the storage buffers, etc. This way the Set* function would be called at most once per bind group.",
      "revId": "95257fd5dc5b9e4be70a5dd65e0127c2d378900d",
